					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3740708,
					"content": "…可疑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3740711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 3740711,
					"content": "哈哈哈，这一招对吟游诗人是无效的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3740712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3740712,
					"content": "那么，该怎么拿到天空之琴呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3740713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 3740713,
					"content": "据说它被供奉在大教堂深处，某个安全的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3740714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3740714,
					"content": "我会去探查一下情况，你有兴趣的话也可以跟来看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3740709,
					"content": "有限地相信一下也没坏处…",
